2
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:08,380
Hey, it's your Thanksgiving, too.
嘿，這也是你的感恩節。

3
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:10,880
You know, instead of watching football, you could help.
你知道，除了看足球之外，還可以幫忙。

4
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:11,800
We will.
我們將。

5
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:17,160
Uh, Rachel, you want to put the marshmallows in concentric circles.
呃，雷切爾，你想把棉花糖放在同心圓上。

6
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:21,860
No, Mon, you want to put them in concentric circles.
不，Mon，你想把它們放在同心圓中。

7
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:24,560
I want to do this.
我想做這個。

8
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:34,660
Every year.
每年。

9
00:00:51,860 --> 00:01:01,360
It's like you're always stuck in second gear, when it hasn't been your day, or maybe your month, or even your year.
這就像你總是被困在第二檔，當它不是你的一天，或者可能是你的月份，甚至是你的一年。

10
00:01:01,720 --> 00:01:07,140
But, I'll be there for you, when the rain starts to pour.
但是，當雨開始傾盆大雨時，我會在你身邊。

11
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:12,160
I'll be there for you, like I've been there before.
我會在你身邊，就像我以前來過一樣。

12
00:01:12,320 --> 00:01:17,400
I'll be there for you, because you're there for me, too.
我會在你身邊，因為你也在我身邊。

13
00:01:23,160 --> 00:01:25,420
Let's give a hand to the five touchdowns team!
讓我們為五次達陣隊伸出援手吧！

14
00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:29,740
You know, for once, I am going to sit down and try to watch one of these things.
你知道，這一次，我將坐下來嘗試觀看其中的一件事。

15
00:01:32,140 --> 00:01:32,460
Halftime.
半場結束。

16
00:01:35,020 --> 00:01:38,540
Hey, who wants to, uh, throw the ball around a little? Maybe get a little three-on-three going.
嘿，誰願意，呃，把球扔來扔去？也許可以進行一些三對三的比賽。

17
00:01:38,700 --> 00:01:40,280
Oh, that would be so much fun.
哦，那會非常有趣。

18
00:01:40,420 --> 00:01:43,140
Oh, can I play, too? I've never played football, like, ever.
哦，我也可以玩嗎？我從來沒有踢過足球，從來沒有。

19
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,660
Great, you can cover Chandler.
太好了，你可以掩護錢德勒了。

20
00:01:48,260 --> 00:01:50,100
No, no, I don't really want to play.
不不不，我真的不想玩。

21
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:53,700
Come on, man, you haven't wanted to do anything since you and Janice broke up.
得了吧，夥計，自從你和珍妮絲分手後，你就什麼都不想做了。

22
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:57,180
That's not true. I wanted to wear my bathrobe and eat peanut clusters all day.
那不是真的。我想穿著浴衣，整天吃花生串。

23
00:01:58,280 --> 00:02:01,420
I wanted to start drinking in the morning. Don't say that I don't have goals.
我想早上開始喝酒。別說我沒有目標。

24
00:02:02,380 --> 00:02:05,120
Chandler, you have to start getting over her, all right?
錢德，你必須開始忘記她，好嗎？

25
00:02:05,140 --> 00:02:08,840
If you play, you get some fresh air, maybe you'll take your mind off Janice.
如果你玩，你可以呼吸新鮮空氣，也許你就能把注意力從賈妮絲身上轉移開。

26
00:02:09,160 --> 00:02:13,140
And if you don't play, everyone will be mad at you, because the teams won't be even. Come on.
如果你不參加比賽，每個人都會生你的氣，因為球隊不會平衡。快點。

27
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:18,300
All right, I'll play, but don't like you.
好吧，我會玩，但不喜歡你。

28
00:02:19,060 --> 00:02:22,060
Yay, let's do it! Ross?
耶，讓我們開始吧！羅斯？

29
00:02:22,160 --> 00:02:22,400
What?
什麼？

30
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:23,180
Want to play football?
想踢足球嗎？

31
00:02:25,660 --> 00:02:29,020
Um, Monica and I aren't supposed to play football.
嗯，莫妮卡和我不應該踢足球。

32
00:02:30,660 --> 00:02:32,080
Says who, your mom?
誰說的，你媽媽？

33
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:34,520
Yes.
是的。

34
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:40,160
What do you mean? She asks her boyfriend, really scared to hear the answer.
你是什麼意思？她問她的男朋友，很害怕聽到答案。

35
00:02:41,380 --> 00:02:47,080
Well, every Thanksgiving, um, we used to have a touch football game called the Geller Ball.
嗯，每年感恩節，嗯，我們曾經舉辦一場名為「蓋勒球」的觸身式橄欖球比賽。

36
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:49,260
No, no, no, you say that proudly.
不不不，你這麼自豪地說。

37
00:02:50,860 --> 00:02:55,700
Anyway, Ross and I were always captains, and, um, it got kind of competitive,
不管怎樣，羅斯和我一直都是隊長，而且，嗯，這有點競爭，

38
00:02:56,080 --> 00:03:01,320
and one year, Geller Ball 6, I accidentally broke Ross's nose.
還有一年，Geller Ball 6，我不小心打斷了羅斯的鼻子。

39
00:03:02,740 --> 00:03:07,060
It was so not an accident. She saw I was about to tag her,
這並不是意外。她看到我要標記她，

40
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:09,960
so she threw her big fat grandma arm elbow in my face.
所以她把她那又大又胖的奶奶手肘扔到了我臉上。

41
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,160
Just kept running.
只是繼續跑。

42
00:03:13,020 --> 00:03:15,120
To score the winning touchdown, by the way.
順便說一句，要取得致勝達陣。

43
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:19,780
You did not win the game. The touchdown didn't count
你沒有贏得比賽。達陣不算數

44
00:03:19,780 --> 00:03:23,980
because of the spectacularly illegal, oh, and by the way, savage nose breaking.
因為這種行為極度違法，哦，順便說一句，還有野蠻的打斷鼻子行為。

45
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:26,960
I won the game.
我贏了比賽。

46
00:03:27,740 --> 00:03:30,060
Oh, yeah? Then how come you didn't get the Geller Cup?
哦，是嗎？那你為什麼沒有獲得蓋勒杯呢？

47
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:34,000
There was a Geller Cup?
有蓋勒杯嗎？

48
00:03:35,420 --> 00:03:37,860
Yes, it was the trophy you got if you won the game,
是的，這就是你贏得比賽後獲得的獎杯，

49
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:42,760
but our dad said nobody won that game, and he was sick of our fighting, so he took the trophy...
但我們的爸爸說那場比賽沒人贏，他厭倦了我們的爭鬥，所以他拿走了獎盃…

50
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,120
threw it in a lake.
把它丟進湖裡。

51
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,560
And was the curse lifted?
那麼詛咒解除了嗎？

52
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:02,020
Anyway, that's when mom said we were not allowed to play football again.
無論如何，就在那時媽媽說我們不準再踢足球了。

53
00:04:02,780 --> 00:04:05,460
You know what? I think we should play a game.
你知道嗎？我想我們應該要玩個遊戲。

54
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:07,520
I mean, come on, it's been 12 years.
我的意思是，來吧，已經12年了。

55
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:09,540
Can I see you for a second?
我可以見你一下嗎？

56
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:15,660
What?
什麼？

57
00:04:16,220 --> 00:04:17,680
All right, we're gonna play.
好吧，我們要玩了。

58
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:20,100
Okay, wait a minute, though.
好吧，等一下。

59
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:20,840
How are we gonna get there?
我們怎樣才能到達那裡？

60
00:04:20,940 --> 00:04:22,640
Because my mom won't let me cross the street.
因為我媽媽不讓我過馬路。

61
00:04:26,500 --> 00:04:26,820
Hey.
嘿。

62
00:04:27,980 --> 00:04:28,300
Hey.
嘿。

63
00:04:30,380 --> 00:04:31,020
All right.
好的。

64
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:32,360
Okay, let's bring it in.
好吧，我們把它帶進來吧。

65
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:34,800
Wait, no, honey, honey, throw it to me, throw it to me.
等等，不，親愛的，親愛的，把它丟給我，把它丟給我。

66
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:35,440
Here you go.
幹得好。

67
00:04:38,780 --> 00:04:40,180
That almost hit me in the face.
這差點打到我臉上了。

68
00:04:41,640 --> 00:04:43,320
All right, we have to pick captains.
好吧，我們得選隊長了。

69
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:44,600
And then to kneels.
然後跪下。

70
00:04:47,820 --> 00:04:49,340
Okay, so how do we decide that?
好吧，那我們要如何決定呢？

71
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,780
Well, why don't we just bunny up?
好吧，我們為什麼不乾脆兔子起來呢？

72
00:04:51,140 --> 00:04:51,220
What?
什麼？

73
00:04:52,100 --> 00:04:52,460
Bunny!
兔子！

74
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:56,640
Okay, looks like Ross and I are captains.
好吧，看起來羅斯和我都是隊長。

75
00:04:57,920 --> 00:05:01,340
There must be a special place in heaven for people that hung out with you two in high school.
對於高中時和你們兩個一起出去玩的人來說，天堂裡一定有一個特別的地方。

76
00:05:02,940 --> 00:05:05,420
Okay, so I bunnied first, which means I get to pick first.
好吧，所以我先選兔子，這意味著我可以先選。

77
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:06,120
Joey.
喬伊。

78
00:05:06,340 --> 00:05:06,760
Thank you.
謝謝。

79
00:05:07,500 --> 00:05:09,660
Monica, I'm your best friend.
莫妮卡，我是你最好的朋友。

80
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,920
Sweetie, don't worry, you'll get picked.
親愛的，別擔心，你會被選中的。

81
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:13,700
Chandler.
錢德勒。

82
00:05:17,180 --> 00:05:17,620
Ross.
羅斯.

83
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:18,220
Phoebe.
菲比。

84
00:05:22,320 --> 00:05:23,820
Sweetie, now I pick you.
親愛的，現在我選你了。

85
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:26,400
You don't pick me, you're stuck with me.
你不選擇我，你就被我困住了。

86
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:30,120
Okay, all right, so let's see.
好吧，好吧，讓我們看看。

87
00:05:30,220 --> 00:05:33,220
Let's play from the trash can to the light post, right?
我們從垃圾桶到燈柱玩吧？

88
00:05:33,540 --> 00:05:35,000
Two hand touch, we'll kick off.
兩隻手觸碰，我們就開始了。

89
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:35,920
All right, people, listen.
好吧，各位，聽著。

90
00:05:36,140 --> 00:05:39,400
I've got exactly 28 minutes before I have to baste again.
距離我必須再次塗醬還有整整 28 分鐘。

91
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:41,640
Wow, just like in the pros.
哇，就像職業選手一樣。

92
00:05:42,820 --> 00:05:44,020
Okay, have a look.
好吧，看看吧。

93
00:05:44,700 --> 00:05:45,860
All right, huddle up, get over here.
好吧，擠在一起，到這裡來。

94
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:47,400
Wait for me, wait for me, wait for me.
等我，等我，等我。

95
00:05:48,540 --> 00:05:50,400
Oh, cool, this is my first huddle.
噢，太棒了，這是我第一次聚會。

96
00:05:51,540 --> 00:05:54,640
Okay, okay, so what do you guys really think of Chandler?
好吧，好吧，那你們對錢德勒到底有什麼看法呢？

97
00:05:57,340 --> 00:05:58,880
Phoebe, you know what you're doing, right?
菲比，你知道你在做什麼，對吧？

98
00:05:59,180 --> 00:05:59,480
Yeah.
是的。

99
00:06:00,220 --> 00:06:02,540
Okay, all right, Joey's gonna catch it and you and I are gonna block.
好吧，好吧，喬伊會接住它，你和我會阻止。

100
00:06:02,760 --> 00:06:03,240
Let's block.
我們來阻止吧。

101
00:06:04,660 --> 00:06:05,900
Phoebe, I thought you said you know what you were doing.
菲比，我以為你說過你知道自己在做什麼。

102
00:06:06,420 --> 00:06:07,660
I thought you meant in life.
我以為你指的是生活。

103
00:06:09,700 --> 00:06:10,060
Great.
偉大的。

104
00:06:11,380 --> 00:06:13,800
The ball is Janice, the ball is Janice.
球是珍妮絲，球是珍妮絲。

105
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:21,440
Oh, oh, oh, son of a...
啊啊啊啊啊啊兒子啊…

106
00:06:21,440 --> 00:06:23,140
Ow, come on.
噢，來吧。

107
00:06:23,320 --> 00:06:24,200
Sorry, I'm sorry.
對不起，對不起。

108
00:06:24,620 --> 00:06:25,000
You know what?
你知道嗎？

109
00:06:25,020 --> 00:06:25,980
We're just gonna throw it.
我們只是要把它丟掉。

110
00:06:28,220 --> 00:06:29,080
I got it.
我得到了它。

111
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:30,860
Go, go, go.
去！去！去。

112
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:33,740
Oh, oh, oh.
哦，哦，哦。

113
00:06:34,980 --> 00:06:35,400
Yeah!
是的！

114
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:35,800
Woo-hoo!
嗚呼！

115
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,040
Score!
分數！

116
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:40,840
Score!
分數！

117
00:06:41,540 --> 00:06:42,780
Seven to nothing.
七無。

118
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:46,580
Okay, honey, just so that I'm clear on this.
好吧，親愛的，只是為了讓我清楚這一點。

119
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,940
Now, you said in the huddle that if Joey caught the ball,
現在，你們在人群中說，如果喬伊接住了球，

120
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,400
you were gonna be the one to stop him.
你會成為阻止他的人。

121
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:51,460
Now, you didn't.
現在，你沒有。

122
00:06:51,660 --> 00:06:53,620
So is that like a, like a football strategy?
那麼這就像足球策略嗎？

123
00:06:53,740 --> 00:06:56,300
Yeah, it was part of my plan to fall instantly behind.
是的，這是我計劃的一部分，立即落後。

124
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:58,100
So, come on, let's go.
那麼，來吧，我們走吧。

125
00:06:59,540 --> 00:07:00,260
Losers walk.
失敗者行走。

126
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:02,440
Yeah, losers talk.
是的，失敗者會說話。

127
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,440
No, no, no, actually, losers rhyme.
不，不，不，實際上，失敗者押韻。

128
00:07:07,700 --> 00:07:09,980
Point three, 74.
第三點，74。

129
00:07:14,500 --> 00:07:15,380
You wanna go shotgun?
你想用霰彈槍嗎？

130
00:07:15,580 --> 00:07:15,760
Yeah.
是的。

131
00:07:18,780 --> 00:07:21,220
Hey, one Mississippi, two Mississippi, three Mississippi.
嘿，一個密西西比州，兩個密西西比州，三個密西西比州。

132
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:21,920
Over here, over here, over here.
這邊，這邊，這邊。

133
00:07:23,660 --> 00:07:24,680
I almost caught that one.
我差一點就抓住那個了。

134
00:07:26,540 --> 00:07:28,560
Great, now the score is seven to almost seven.
太好了，現在比數是七比七了。

135
00:07:31,140 --> 00:07:32,120
Okay, let's play.
好吧，讓我們來玩吧。

136
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:34,420
I want you to do a down and out to the right, okay?
我要你從右往下做，好嗎？

137
00:07:34,700 --> 00:07:34,840
Okay.
好的。

138
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:35,220
Great.
偉大的。

139
00:07:35,460 --> 00:07:36,380
Wait, what am I gonna do?
等等，我要做什麼？

140
00:07:37,900 --> 00:07:39,340
You, you go long.
你，你走得遠。

141
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:40,140
Well, how long?
嗯，多久？

142
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:42,720
Until we start to look very small.
直到我們開始看起來很小。

143
00:07:42,780 --> 00:07:43,240
Okay.
好的。

144
00:07:43,900 --> 00:07:48,180
Hey, one Mississippi, two Mississippi.
嘿，一個密西西比河，兩個密西西比河。

145
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:49,680
Switch, switch, switch.
開關，開關，開關。

146
00:07:50,300 --> 00:07:51,180
No, no, no, no, no, no, no.
不，不，不，不，不，不，不。

147
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:58,440
Oh.
哦。

148
00:08:00,700 --> 00:08:02,760
Hey, thanks for stopping our ball.
嘿，謝謝你阻止我們的球。

149
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:05,140
You are playing American football?
你在踢美式足球嗎？

150
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:05,680
Yeah.
是的。

151
00:08:06,280 --> 00:08:08,860
Wow, you're like from a whole other country.
哇，你就像來自另一個國家。

152
00:08:10,140 --> 00:08:11,140
I'm Dutch.
我是荷蘭人。

153
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:12,440
Hi, I'm Joey.
嗨，我是喬伊。

154
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:14,860
I'm Marja.
我是瑪嘉。

155
00:08:15,960 --> 00:08:17,840
I'm sorry, Dutch, I didn't get that last little bit.
對不起，荷蘭人，我沒聽懂最後一點。

156
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:20,560
Hey, Joey, you wanna play football or you wanna hide?
嘿，喬伊，你想踢足球還是想躲起來？

157
00:08:20,660 --> 00:08:21,140
I'm Chandler.
我是錢德勒。

158
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,340
Hello, Chandler.
你好，錢德勒。

159
00:08:23,820 --> 00:08:26,220
Her name is Dutch and also Marjan.
她的名字是荷蘭語，也叫馬裡安。

160
00:08:28,340 --> 00:08:28,900
Marja.
瑪嘉。

161
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:30,000
Marja.
瑪嘉。

162
00:08:30,780 --> 00:08:31,340
Marja.
瑪嘉。

163
00:08:32,380 --> 00:08:32,940
Marjan.
馬裡安.

164
00:08:35,760 --> 00:08:36,320
Marja.
瑪嘉。

165
00:08:36,780 --> 00:08:37,920
Yo, flirty boys.
喲，輕浮的男孩們。

166
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:40,000
We're in the middle of a game.
我們正在玩遊戲。

167
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:42,120
Come on, guys, let's go.
來吧，夥計們，我們走吧。

168
00:08:42,380 --> 00:08:43,580
Come on, second down.
來吧，第二個。

169
00:08:44,300 --> 00:08:45,900
Uh, hello, it's third down.
呃，你好，這是第三個。

170
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:47,240
No, it's not, it's second.
不，不是，是第二。

171
00:08:48,620 --> 00:08:49,100
Wow.
哇。

172
00:08:49,660 --> 00:08:50,460
Wow, what?
哇，什麼？

173
00:08:50,920 --> 00:08:53,920
Uh, just amazes me that you're still pulling stuff like this.
呃，讓我驚訝的是你還在做這樣的事情。

174
00:08:55,420 --> 00:08:56,140
Pulling what?
拉什麼？

175
00:08:56,180 --> 00:08:56,940
It's second down.
已經倒數第二了

176
00:08:57,420 --> 00:08:58,600
Okay, it's second down.
好吧，倒數第二了。

177
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:01,180
Take all the second downs you need.
接受你需要的所有第二次擊倒。

178
00:09:02,420 --> 00:09:03,440
I heard that.
我聽到了。

179
00:09:03,760 --> 00:09:04,760
Well, I said it loud.
嗯，我大聲說出來了。

180
00:09:06,900 --> 00:09:09,040
It is okay if I stay and watch?
我留下來看看可以嗎？

181
00:09:09,460 --> 00:09:11,140
I can't go home just yet.
我現在還不能回家。

182
00:09:11,280 --> 00:09:16,240
My roommate is, um, for schlocking a big American businessman.
我的室友，呃，因為欺騙了一位美國大商人。

183
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:19,020
Yeah, why don't you stick around?
是啊，為什麼不留下來呢？

184
00:09:20,800 --> 00:09:21,620
Well, that went well.
嗯，進展順利。

185
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:22,360
I think so.
我想是的。

186
00:09:22,880 --> 00:09:25,340
You know, I was thinking about, uh, asking her for her number.
你知道，我在想，呃，向她要電話號碼。

187
00:09:25,980 --> 00:09:29,820
Thanks, man, but I think it makes a stronger statement if I ask for it myself, you know?
謝謝，夥計，但我認為如果我自己提出要求，這會是一個更有說服力的宣告，你知道嗎？

188
00:09:31,540 --> 00:09:33,940
No, I was thinking about, you know, for me,
不，我在想，你知道，對我來說，

189
00:09:34,060 --> 00:09:36,380
as part of that whole getting over Janice thing you were talking about.
作為你所說的克服賈妮絲這件事的一部分。

190
00:09:37,540 --> 00:09:38,300
Oh, yeah, that.
哦，是的，那個。

191
00:09:39,780 --> 00:09:41,960
All right, if it means that much, I'll let you have her.
好吧，如果這很重要的話，我會讓你擁有她。

192
00:09:42,020 --> 00:09:42,300
Thanks.
謝謝。

193
00:09:43,900 --> 00:09:44,260
What?
什麼？

194
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,640
Let me have her?
讓我擁有她？

195
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:47,420
What do you mean?
你是什麼意思？

196
00:09:47,460 --> 00:09:49,280
Like, if you didn't, I wouldn't have a shot?
比如說，如果你不這麼做，我就不會有機會？

197
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:51,760
Well, you don't like to say it out loud, but...
好吧，你不喜歡大聲說出來，但...

198
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:53,760
Yeah.
是的。

199
00:09:55,620 --> 00:09:56,760
Don't feel bad, man.
別難過，老兄。

200
00:09:56,780 --> 00:09:57,780
We all have our strengths.
我們都有自己的長處。

201
00:09:57,860 --> 00:09:59,100
You're better with numbers and stuff.
你對數字和其他東西更擅長。

202
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:00,400
Math?
數學？

203
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,140
You're giving me math?
你給我數學？

204
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:04,840
All right, look, you know what?
好吧，看，你知道嗎？

205
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:05,760
Forget about it.
忘記它吧。

206
00:10:06,280 --> 00:10:07,100
You go for the girl.
你去找那個女孩吧。

207
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:08,740
We'll see who gets her.
我們看看誰能得到她。

208
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:15,480
Chandler, I want you to run a post pattern to the left, okay?
錢德勒，我想讓你在左邊跑一個後模式，好嗎？

209
00:10:15,620 --> 00:10:16,240
And, sweetie...
還有，親愛的...

210
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:16,800
Yeah, I know.
是的，我知道。

211
00:10:16,900 --> 00:10:17,400
Go long.
走久了。

212
00:10:17,740 --> 00:10:20,040
You know, it's like all I'm doing is running back and forth from the huddle.
你知道，我所做的一切就像是在人群中來回奔跑。

213
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:24,500
Well, uh, you want to just stay out there?
嗯，呃，你想待在那裡嗎？

214
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:26,720
Yeah.
是的。

215
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:31,800
Okay.
好的。

216
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:33,140
Okay, let's go.
好吧，我們走吧。

217
00:10:33,560 --> 00:10:33,820
All right.
好的。

218
00:10:33,860 --> 00:10:34,220
I got you.
我接到你了。

219
00:10:35,180 --> 00:10:37,000
One Mississippi, two Mississippi, three Mississippi.
一個密西西比州，兩個密西西比州，三個密西西比州。

220
00:10:38,520 --> 00:10:38,880
Bumbo.
笨蛋。

221
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:47,000
What the hell's the matter with you?
你到底怎麼了？

222
00:10:47,540 --> 00:10:48,560
It's my favorite jersey.
這是我最喜歡的球衣。

223
00:10:49,300 --> 00:10:50,120
Well, now you have two.
好吧，現在你有兩個了。

224
00:10:52,780 --> 00:10:54,140
Hey, I am good at math.
嘿，我數學很好。

225
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:56,540
All right, that's it.
好吧，就是這樣。

226
00:10:56,620 --> 00:10:57,900
You know, I was still gonna let you have her.
你知道，我仍然會讓你擁有她。

227
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,120
But now, forget about it.
但現在，忘記它吧。

228
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:00,760
Prepare to feel very bad about yourself.
準備好對自己感到非常糟糕。

229
00:11:00,940 --> 00:11:03,260
Hey, well, I've been preparing for that my entire life.
嘿，好吧，我一生都在為此做準備。

230
00:11:04,860 --> 00:11:06,580
Or something about you that's mean.
或關於你的一些卑鄙的事情。

231
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:08,620
All right, come on, guys.
好吧，來吧，夥計們。

232
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:09,120
Let's go.
我們走吧。

233
00:11:09,820 --> 00:11:10,440
It's a high score.
這是一個很高的分數。

234
00:11:10,560 --> 00:11:11,300
We're running out of time.
我們的時間不多了。

235
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,200
42, 38.
42、38。

236
00:11:13,300 --> 00:11:13,500
Hike.
遠足。

237
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:14,900
Oh, I got it.
哦，我明白了。

238
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:18,000
Oh, oh, broken bones.
哦哦，骨頭斷了。

239
00:11:19,820 --> 00:11:21,080
Run, Beanie, run.
跑吧，比尼，跑吧。

240
00:11:26,280 --> 00:11:27,980
Move, move, move.
移動，移動，移動。

241
00:11:28,280 --> 00:11:28,960
Uh, hello.
呃，你好。

242
00:11:29,100 --> 00:11:30,060
The buzzer buzzed.
蜂鳴器響了。

243
00:11:30,060 --> 00:11:30,760
Doesn't count.
不算。

244
00:11:31,300 --> 00:11:32,080
After the snap.
啪啪之後。

245
00:11:32,260 --> 00:11:33,180
Before the snap.
拍響之前。

246
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:33,660
After.
後。

247
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:34,300
Before.
前。

248
00:11:34,780 --> 00:11:35,820
Now, does it really matter?
現在，這真的很重要嗎？

249
00:11:35,900 --> 00:11:36,460
Yes.
是的。

250
00:11:36,740 --> 00:11:38,420
Okay, I made a touchdown.
好吧，我達陣了。

251
00:11:38,580 --> 00:11:39,580
It was my first touchdown.
這是我第一次達陣。

252
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:40,180
So.
所以。

253
00:11:40,540 --> 00:11:41,300
That's great.
那太棒了。

254
00:11:41,380 --> 00:11:41,960
Doesn't count.
不算。

255
00:11:43,220 --> 00:11:44,400
Does so count.
這麼算嗎。

256
00:11:44,560 --> 00:11:45,080
Cheater, cheater.
騙子，騙子。

257
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:45,900
Compulsive eater.
強迫性飲食者。

258
00:11:46,060 --> 00:11:48,900
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

259
00:11:50,680 --> 00:11:51,300
You know what?
你知道嗎？

260
00:11:51,340 --> 00:11:51,800
That's fine.
沒關係。

261
00:11:52,460 --> 00:11:53,660
Maybe you haven't grown up.
也許你還沒長大。

262
00:11:53,860 --> 00:11:54,620
But I have.
但我有。

263
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:55,420
Oh, okay.
哦好的。

264
00:11:56,380 --> 00:11:56,740
Deadlift.
硬拉。

265
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,280
Okay, fine, fine.
好吧，好吧，好吧。

266
00:12:00,340 --> 00:12:00,540
All right.
好的。

267
00:12:00,580 --> 00:12:01,700
You want to win by cheating?
你想透過作弊來獲勝嗎？

268
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:02,160
Go ahead.
前進。

269
00:12:02,260 --> 00:12:02,460
All right.
好的。

270
00:12:02,520 --> 00:12:03,860
Phoebe, the touchdown does count.
菲比，達陣確實很重要。

271
00:12:03,980 --> 00:12:04,400
You win.
你贏了。

272
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:05,440
No.
不。

273
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:09,300
Listen, I'm not going to go through this with you again.
聽著，我不會再跟你經歷這件事了。

274
00:12:09,460 --> 00:12:09,680
Okay.
好的。

275
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:10,540
Just once.
就一次。

276
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:14,160
I want to beat you when you can't blame it on the broken nose or the buzzer or the fact
當你不能將其歸咎於鼻子骨折或蜂鳴器或事實時，我想擊敗你

277
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:15,500
that you thought you might be getting mono.
你認為你可能會罹患單核細胞增多症。

278
00:12:16,020 --> 00:12:16,560
All right.
好的。

279
00:12:16,620 --> 00:12:19,180
Let's just call this tie score and it's half time.
我們就將比數定為平局，半場結束。

280
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:19,500
Okay.
好的。

281
00:12:19,580 --> 00:12:21,060
First of all, I don't play with cheaters.
首先，我不和騙子一起玩。

282
00:12:21,220 --> 00:12:23,780
And second of all, you know I had swollen glands.
其次，你知道我的腺體腫脹。

283
00:12:26,060 --> 00:12:26,820
You know what?
你知道嗎？

284
00:12:27,460 --> 00:12:28,600
I think you'll play.
我想你會玩。

285
00:12:29,260 --> 00:12:29,840
Oh, really?
哦真的嗎？

286
00:12:30,100 --> 00:12:30,780
Why is that?
這是為什麼？

287
00:12:31,180 --> 00:12:32,720
Because the winner gets this.
因為勝利者會得到這個。

288
00:12:33,420 --> 00:12:34,640
The killer cup.
殺手杯。

289
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:41,140
Is everybody else seeing a troll doll nailed to a two by four?
其他人是否都看到一個巨魔娃娃被釘在二乘四的身上？

290
00:12:43,140 --> 00:12:44,080
Okay, good.
好的，很好。

291
00:12:48,020 --> 00:12:49,940
Okay, where the hell did you get that?
好吧，你到底從哪裡拿到的？

292
00:12:50,220 --> 00:12:54,020
When mom and dad drove you to the hospital to get your nose fixed, I swam into the lake
當爸爸媽媽開車送你去醫院整鼻子時，我遊進了湖裡

293
00:12:54,020 --> 00:12:54,860
and fished it out.
並把它撈出來。

294
00:12:55,560 --> 00:12:56,840
That cup is mine.
那個杯子是我的。

295
00:12:56,980 --> 00:12:57,700
No, it's not.
不，不是。

296
00:12:58,100 --> 00:12:58,660
You want it.
你想要它。

297
00:12:59,100 --> 00:13:00,100
You're going to have to win it.
你必須贏得它。

298
00:13:00,340 --> 00:13:00,560
All right.
好的。

299
00:13:00,660 --> 00:13:02,080
So are we not having dinner at all?
那我們根本不吃晚餐嗎？

300
00:13:03,940 --> 00:13:06,460
Hey, could you could you please set the timer, Martha?
嘿，瑪莎，你能設定一下定時器嗎？

301
00:13:07,280 --> 00:13:08,000
Okay, beefy.
不錯，牛逼

302
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:12,580
Come on, let's go.
來吧，我們走吧。

303
00:13:12,680 --> 00:13:12,900
Come on.
快點。

304
00:13:12,920 --> 00:13:13,740
It's time to get serious.
是時候認真起來了。

305
00:13:13,740 --> 00:13:14,280
Huddle up.
蜷縮。

306
00:13:15,760 --> 00:13:17,220
Joey, keep your head in the game.
喬伊，在比賽中保持頭腦清醒。

307
00:13:17,940 --> 00:13:19,020
It's hard, you know?
這很難，你知道嗎？

308
00:13:19,300 --> 00:13:20,900
His huddle is close to the Dutch girl.
他的擁抱離荷蘭女孩很近。

309
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:25,520
All right, look, if I take Chandler out of the running, will you be able to focus?
好吧，聽著，如果我讓錢德勒退出競選，你能集中註意力嗎？

310
00:13:26,420 --> 00:13:27,160
What are you going to do?
你會怎樣做？

311
00:13:27,520 --> 00:13:29,020
All right, you just make sure he catches the ball.
好吧，你只要確保他接住球就好了。

312
00:13:29,500 --> 00:13:30,580
I'll take care of the rest.
剩下的事我會處理的。

313
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:30,940
Okay.
好的。

314
00:13:31,060 --> 00:13:31,840
Come on, you wolf.
來吧，你這隻狼。

315
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:32,100
Here you go.
幹得好。

316
00:13:32,380 --> 00:13:33,160
Okay, come on.
好吧，來吧。

317
00:13:34,540 --> 00:13:35,120
Go, Chandler.
走吧，錢德勒。

318
00:13:35,300 --> 00:13:35,940
I got it.
我得到了它。

319
00:13:36,100 --> 00:13:36,420
Come on, come on.
來吧，來吧。

320
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:37,180
Yes, go, run.
是的，走，跑。

321
00:13:37,660 --> 00:13:38,020
Hi.
你好。

322
00:13:39,020 --> 00:13:39,580
Look out.
當心。

323
00:13:40,560 --> 00:13:45,680
Whoa, whoa, tackled by a girl.
嗚嗚嗚，被妹子欺負了。

324
00:13:46,180 --> 00:13:47,580
Guess you don't see that every day, do you?
我想你不會每天都看到這個吧？

325
00:13:48,520 --> 00:13:49,420
Whoa, whoa, whoa.
哇，哇，哇。

326
00:13:49,620 --> 00:13:50,540
What's with the tackling?
對付有什麼關係？

327
00:13:51,620 --> 00:13:52,040
What?
什麼？

328
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:54,700
I just touched him and he went over.
我剛碰了碰他，他就走了過去。

329
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:57,200
Okay, you want to play rough?
好吧，你想玩粗暴的嗎？

330
00:13:57,760 --> 00:13:59,080
We can play rough.
我們可以粗暴地玩。

331
00:13:59,680 --> 00:14:01,800
Let's get ready to rumble.
讓我們準備好隆隆作響吧。

332
00:14:10,580 --> 00:14:11,740
Y'all ready for this?
你們準備好了嗎？

333
00:14:47,900 --> 00:14:49,680
I love this game.
我喜歡這個遊戲。

334
00:14:52,920 --> 00:14:53,960
Hey, what'd you get there?
嘿，你在那裡得到了什麼？

335
00:14:54,860 --> 00:14:56,420
I went really long.
我走了很長一段時間。

336
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:00,020
42 to 21.
42 至 21。

337
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:01,080
Like the turkey.
就像火雞一樣。

338
00:15:01,260 --> 00:15:02,120
Ross is done.
羅斯完成了。

339
00:15:03,940 --> 00:15:06,580
See, it's no surprise that you're winning because you got to pick first.
你看，你贏了並不奇怪，因為你必須先選。

340
00:15:06,620 --> 00:15:07,380
So you got the better team.
所以你得到了更好的團隊。

341
00:15:07,700 --> 00:15:08,520
You're so pathetic.
你真可憐。

342
00:15:09,060 --> 00:15:10,140
Why can't you just accept it?
為什麼你就不能接受呢？

343
00:15:10,140 --> 00:15:12,240
We're winning because I'm better than you.
我們贏了，因為我比你強。

344
00:15:12,880 --> 00:15:14,480
Oh, what a great argument.
哦，多麼精彩的爭論。

345
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:15,520
Exhaling.
呼氣。

346
00:15:16,980 --> 00:15:17,740
All right, you know what?
好吧，你知道嗎？

347
00:15:17,760 --> 00:15:18,820
I'll prove it to you, okay?
我會證明給你看，好嗎？

348
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:22,880
I'll trade you Joey for Rachel and I'll still win the game.
我會把你喬伊換成瑞秋，我還是會贏得比賽。

349
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:23,920
Oh, that's great.
哦，那太好了。

350
