That's when I realized there's more important things than beating you at football.
就在那時我意識到有比在足球比賽中擊敗你更重要的事情。

527
00:24:04,720 --> 00:24:05,820
Things like feet.
比如腳之類的東西。

528
00:24:07,060 --> 00:24:07,880
I know.
我知道。

529
00:24:08,200 --> 00:24:10,420
This thing is causing too much pain and suffering.
這件事造成了太多的痛苦和折磨。

530
00:24:10,660 --> 00:24:10,900
Yeah.
是的。

531
00:24:11,020 --> 00:24:11,660
It's time.
是時候了。

532
00:24:12,560 --> 00:24:13,600
We'll just call it a tie.
我們就稱之為平局。

533
00:24:14,460 --> 00:24:15,080
It's a tie.
這是一條領帶。

534
00:24:15,300 --> 00:24:15,880
All right.
好的。

535
00:24:16,980 --> 00:24:17,200
Okay.
好的。

536
00:24:18,880 --> 00:24:19,320
Okay.
好的。

537
00:24:24,300 --> 00:24:25,260
Good night.
晚安。

538
00:24:25,260 --> 00:24:26,060
Good night.
晚安。

539
00:24:29,640 --> 00:24:30,820
Phoebe, did you get it?
菲比，你收到了嗎？

540
00:24:31,260 --> 00:24:32,280
Yeah, I got it.
是的，我明白了。

541
00:24:32,360 --> 00:24:32,900
Great.
偉大的。

542
00:24:33,740 --> 00:24:34,420
Bring it up.
把它提出來。

543
00:24:34,880 --> 00:24:37,160
There's champagne in my apartment for the winners.
我的公寓裡為獲獎者準備了香檳。

544
00:24:38,860 --> 00:24:41,220
What are you doing down here?
你在下面做什麼？

545
00:24:41,520 --> 00:24:43,460
Uh, nothing.
呃，沒什麼。

